too long not enough knuckles too much  knuckles generic franchise cash grab or  full throttle family adventure the  critics have seen the sonic sequel  here's what they're saying when fans got  their first look at the sonic the  hedgehog movie back in 2019 there was an  uproar over the blue speedster's design  which tried to make the legendary video  game character look a little too human  uh  meow  paramount quickly rushed to redesign the  iconic hedgehog but it seemed like the  project might have been doomed before  its release thankfully that wasn't the  case and the film eventually managed to  win audiences over raking in 319 million  dollars worldwide it was more than  enough for the studio to greenlight a  sequel which started production in 2021  and now it's finally almost here the  first trailer for the sequel revealed  that sonic is joined by tails this time  around as they go up against the  sinister doctor robotnik and his new  henchman knuckles echidna the first  reactions from critics have now arrived  online ahead of the movie's april 8th  release date and they seem to be  impressed with the sequel for the most  part although the first reviews for  sonic the hedgehog 2 have featured their  fair share of criticism it disappeared  that for the most part critics  appreciate the sequel for its fun  atmosphere and new characters the radio  times patrick ramona wrote ben schwartz  gives another perky vocal performance in  the role full of warmth and humor while  colin o'shaughnessy makes a successful  transition from video games to film as  tales meanwhile game radar's bradley  russell found idris elba's knuckles to  be a worthy addition to the series he  wrote the bristling echidna's  hard-hitting approach is welcome  providing a far more physical threat for  sonic here than anything found in the  original movie however russell did also  criticize the sequel for being too  similar to the first film writing the  story beats here follow the same  well-worn path as the 2020 film with  robotnik's mad schemes and the power of  friendship message feeling it touched  reheated a second time around meanwhile  sean keane of cnet praised the movie for  capturing the sense of adventure fans  might remember from their childhoods he  also singled out the visual effects  adding every sequence focusing on sonic  and pals is so visually delightful and  thoroughly dazzling however not everyone  was quite as impressed with the movie  writing for variety peter de bruge  argued that the sequel takes what was  endearing about the original and renders  it generic in a hurry he went on to  criticize the movie's long runtime  writing an hour and a half would have  been a perfectly fine run time whereas  at 2 hours and change sonic 2 wears out  its welcome well before it turns into  yet another phonetin franchise entry the  early reactions from critics suggest  that paramount has a success on its  hands with sonic the hedgehog 2.  although whether it will be the original  film's box office haul remains to be  seen fans clearly love the first film as  it has a 93 audience score on rotten  tomatoes so families may well flock to  theaters on opening weekend the mostly  positive early reactions will also  likely reassure the studio that the  money has been a worthy investment this  will be welcome news to paramount of  course who has already given the green  light for sonic the hedgehog 3. that  announcement arrived back in february  2022 alongside the news that a spin-off  series focused on idris elba's knuckles  is also in development for paramount  plus the live-action show is clearly the  first step in expanding the sonic the  hedgehog franchise and it'll be  interesting to see whether other  characters will get their own shows  further down the line producer neil h  moritz spoke a deadline about the third  sequel and the spin-off saying the sky  is truly the limit and i am immensely  proud to be part of creating new sonic  content for longtime fans as well as  introducing sonic to a new generation so  where might the third movie go plot wise  well there are plenty of other heroes  anti-heroes and villains in a sonic  world who could easily feature in the  movie and many of them might even be  able to carry their own projects but  however the franchise plays out in the  future based on the early reviews for  sonic the hedgehog 2 it looks like sonic  is here to stay  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

